        "answer": {
          "short": "In order: $0.1,\\ 0.2,\\ 0.3,\\ 0.6,\\ 1,\\ 1.7,\\ 3,\\ 5.2,\\ 9$.",
          "worked": "Substitute each input into $y=3^x$ and round only the final values where necessary.\n$$\\begin{align*}3^{-2}&=\\frac19\\approx0.1\\\\3^{-1.5}&=\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt3}\\approx0.2\\\\3^{-1}&=\\frac13\\approx0.3\\\\3^{-0.5}&=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt3}\\approx0.6\\\\3^0&=1\\\\3^{0.5}&=\\sqrt3\\approx1.7\\\\3^1&=3\\\\3^{1.5}&=3\\sqrt3\\approx5.2\\\\3^2&=9\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 0,
        "responseSpace": "scaffold"
      },
